    "text": "Lotte Foods' Kistick Pokémon sausages came with Pokémon extras. The 500 g pack released in October 2016 included a Pokémon card, one of Psyduck, Pikachu, Mewtwo, Rayquaza and Snorlax 163 to 167/XY-P. Ash's Pikachu cards 044/SM-P to 049/SM-P came with the sausages in 2018, and a second run, 120/SM-P to 124/SM-P, followed in 2019."
